          "code": "GENERATE_ANSWER",
          "id": "1771373507380",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771373507383_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Customer Service Representative (CSR) assisting an end user/customer. The customer's chat conversation has been condensed down to a problem statement needing to be solved.\n\nDescription of problem:\n{{$context.$nodes.PROBLEM_STATEMENT_TEXT.$output.result}}\n\nGenerate a response to the problem using the available references. The format of the response should as follows:\n- Tailor the response as if you are the CSR speaking directly to the customer.\n- Use professional tone, punctuation, etc.\n- Offer precise steps or actions if applicable in order to solve the problem\n- If reference(s) is/are used, include citation:\n {{$context.$nodes.LINK_FORMAT_INSTRUCTIONS.$output.result}}\n- If reference is not applicable, do not include\n- If more information is needed to properly solve the problem, include this as a question to the customer to collect that information. However, prefer solutions to follow-up questions - try to solve the problem as best as possible with given information. Solve the problem first, ask follow-up questions last.\n- Keep response short enough to fit into a chat UI window while keeping relevant information\n- Do not include information not in the references\n\n- Format output as simple html fragment (do not surround with html and body tags)\n\nReferences:\n{{$context.$nodes.REFERENCES_PROMPT.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"string\"\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5245,
            "y": 9512
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Answer Text",
            "language": "JAVASCRIPT",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let value = $context.$nodes.GENERATE_ANSWER.$output;\nlet result = \"\";\n\nif (typeof value === \"string\") {\n  result = value.trim();\n} else if (value && typeof value.answer === \"string\") {\n  result = value.answer.trim();\n} else if (value && typeof value.content === \"string\") {\n  result = value.content.trim();\n} else if (value && typeof value.description === \"string\") {\n  result = value.description.trim();\n} else if (value && typeof value.default === \"string\") {\n  result = value.default.trim();\n} else if (value && value.result) {\n  if (typeof value.result === \"string\") {\n    result = value.result.trim();\n  } else if (typeof value.result.answer === \"string\") {\n    result = value.result.answer.trim();\n  } else if (typeof value.result.content === \"string\") {\n    result = value.result.content.trim();\n  }\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771374329510"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_ANSWER_TEXT",
          "id": "1774510101002",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
